BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ab9f4f6c-4c71-3da2-aafb-e6aef59e0ed8.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
